5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must understand the operational weight of a new holding before we commit.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to verify if our past narratives match the actual customer retention data.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I am concerned about the cash flow. I need to know what the years after a first round demand of us.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I am worried about the people. Who can we actually hire right now? I need to see the recruiter times.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I need to know what actually delayed our last two holdings. The plans said one thing, reality said another.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
