35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The independent checks show software holdings report only their own dashboards. That opacity worries me for our quarter-end reporting.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The retention data is stark. The shopkeeper tool lost a third of accounts after a price rise. That narrative is false.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,The credit line ignores subscription contracts. That means our seed capital is trapped. I need to know if we can borrow against this new holding.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The recruiters are fast for support roles, but slow for supervisors. Also, our logistics advisers are sitting idle. We have untapped talent!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The delivery records show hardware lost five months to a controller shortage. Software never missed a release. I am checking the reserve accounts now.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, software speed is tempting, but the security review data is a warning. Three quarters for regulated clients. That delays our first revenue.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, security delays are real, but the audit data is more immediate. Hardware requires outside appraisals, adding six weeks and significant fees.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Toshio, the write-off confirms it. Physical assets bleed cash. We need pure software to protect our reserves.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Minako, pure software is great, but who runs it? Our logistics advisers are idle. We need a team that can actually be staffed right now.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Minako, the reserve data confirms it. Hardware calls follow-on capital at double the rate. We are signing up for a cash trap.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, those appraisal fees hit our quarter-end directly. I need clean, verifiable numbers to close the books without external noise.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, exactly. The shopkeeper tool’s retention collapse proves our narrative was fiction. We must avoid hardware to keep our books clean and verifiable.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Mio, staffing is a risk, but the credit line is a hard wall. We cannot borrow against unbilled invoices. We need a model that generates immediate, billable cash.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Minako, I hear you on the cash wall. But if we pick software, we are stuck with the slow supervisor hires. I need a team we can actually build this quarter.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, the controller shortage was external, not a hiring failure. Software avoids that specific supply chain risk.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"I am ready to see the candidates. The data points toward software, but I need to ensure our reporting remains clean and verifiable.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I am ready. The retention data is clear. We must choose a model that keeps its customers and avoids the audit traps of hardware.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,I am ready. The credit line and exit profile are clear. We need a model that respects our borrowing limits and avoids the cash bleed of physical assets.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,I am ready. I just need to ensure we can actually staff the team without waiting four months for supervisors.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
